<div class="kicker reveal">Capabilities — What we do best</div>
<div class="cap-grid">
  <div class="cap-left reveal">
    <h2 class="sec-title">One team.<br /><em>Every frame.</em></h2>
    <p>No hand-offs, no telephone game. Strategy, design, motion, code and sound — all in our Grand St. studio. You get senior people and a faster loop.</p>
    <div class="cap-visual">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522071820081-009f0129c71c?w=1000&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Kinetic studio crew in SoHo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      <div class="overlay"><span>● Grand St Studio — Live</span><span>24 humans + 3 dogs</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <Accordion client:visible />
</div>

<div class="stats reveal" role="list">
  <div class="stat" role="listitem"><b><span data-count="340">0</span><i>+</i></b><span>Projects shipped worldwide</span></div>
  <div class="stat" role="listitem"><b><span data-count="27">0</span><i>×</i></b><span>Intl. awards — D&amp;AD, Cannes, FWA</span></div>
  <div class="stat" role="listitem"><b><span data-count="8">0</span><i>yrs</i></b><span>Independent &amp; NYC-born since 2018</span></div>
  <div class="stat" role="listitem"><b><span data-count="320">0</span><i>M</i></b><span>Organic views on client work</span></div>
</div>
